      "image": "assets/images/10269/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (180 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat softened butter and sugar together in a large bowl with an electric mixer on medium speed until light and fluffy, about 3 to 4 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/6sDG-ltAIYKgHddT-6UUmNsw6QE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/10269-shortbread-cookies-ii-ddmfs-step-3-bbdce7b7392e4b399f68b15837d5be59.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/10269/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir in vanilla; add flour gradually, mixing until a smooth dough forms.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/5pF8f2NBij5umIKc92H5rgEQbTg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/10269-shortbread-cookies-ii-ddmfs-step-4-f3b3a513b3894c9baf2743ebae8235f9.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/10269/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fill cookie press with dough and form cookies onto two ungreased cookie sheets, spacing them about 1 ½ inches apart. Bake in the preheated oven until the edges of the cookies are just starting to turn golden brown, about 10 to 12 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/fjEO-O9IZr_sCfhphP-h4FoEyqw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/10269-shortbread-cookies-ii-ddmfs-step-5-352d27ff443e4e709689816d6f44be6d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/10269/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove the cookie sheets from the oven, and set them on a wire cooling rack for a few minutes. Then transfer the shortbread cookies to the rack to cool completely.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
